# NEVER commit user-generated content. Drafts and session artifacts contain
# sensitive personal information by the nature of this tool.
output/
sessions/
*.draft.md
*.session.json

# Build output. docs/process-map.html IS committed — it's the canonical
# artifact and a test fails when it goes stale against PROCESS.md. The PDF is
# not: it's a ~3 MB raster with no staleness test behind it, and committing a
# new copy every time a diagram moves would bloat the history for a file that
# regenerates in one command. Share it directly, or attach it to a release.
#   python scripts/render_pdf.py
docs/process-map.pdf
docs/.slides/

